The Day Earth Almost Died 🌋☠️ #extinction #volcano #shorts #prehistory,"250 million years ago, a catastrophe far worse than the dinosaur extinction event nearly wiped out all life on Earth. Massive volcanic eruptions in Siberia unleashed unimaginable amounts of greenhouse gases and ash, triggering extreme climate change. Over 90% of marine species and 70% of terrestrial vertebrate species disappeared. This is the story of the Permian-Triassic Extinction, often called 'The Great Dying.' How did life recover from such an apocalyptic event? And could it happen again? #PermianExtinction #GreatDying #Volcanoes #ClimateChange #EarthHistory #ScienceFacts #PrehistoricLife #shorts",Epoch Explorers,1150
Agar Aap 30 Din Tak Bina Soye Raho To Body Par Kya Asar Hoga? 😴 #shorts #bioquest,"Agar Aap 30 Din Tak Bina Soye Raho To Body Par Kya Asar Hoga? 😴 #shorts #bioquest What would happen if a human stayed awake for 30 days straight? 😵‍💫 While 30 days without sleep is practically impossible for humans (records are far less), imagine the hypothetical scenario. Sleep is crucial for bodily functions, mental health, and physical restoration. In this video, we explore the terrifying hypothetical effects on the human body and mind if someone were to attempt to stay awake for an entire month. We'd delve into stages of cognitive decline, extreme hallucinations, severe physiological stress, organ failure risks, and the eventual inability to function. From impaired judgment to compromised immune systems, the lack of sleep can have devastating consequences. If you're fascinated by the human body's limits, health science, and extreme physiological conditions, make sure to like, share, and subscribe for more mind-bending videos. #sleepdeprivation #insomnia #humanbody #sciencefacts #health #bioquest #shorts",BioQuest Shorts,230
