The Merle Gene: This Beautiful Pattern Hides a Deadly Secret,"Merle coated dogs are stunning with their marbled patterns and striking blue eyes. From Australian Shepherds to French Bulldogs, this gene creates some of the most unique-looking pups. But did you know that behind this beautiful genetic trait lies a serious risk? When two dogs carrying the merle gene are bred together, the results can be catastrophic, leading to 'double merle' puppies with severe health issues like blindness, deafness, and even structural abnormalities. This video dives into the fascinating and dangerous science behind the merle gene, explaining why responsible breeding is absolutely crucial to protect these amazing animals. Understanding your dog's genetics isn't just academic; it's about ensuring a healthy, happy life for our beloved companions. #doggenetics #merledog #doghealth #dogfacts #responsiblebreeding #doglovers #didyouknow #dogs #dogscience #caninecode",Canine Code,1575
