Day 01: Cryo-EM Fundamentals for Drug Target Visualization,"Welcome to our new series on cutting-edge techniques in structural biology for drug discovery! This introductory session provides a comprehensive overview of Cryo-Electron Microscopy (Cryo-EM) and its transformative role in visualizing complex biological macromolecules at near-atomic resolution.

