Green Building Materials: Sustainable Construction for the Future | Introduction & Benefits | Civil Engineering,"🌍 Green Building Materials & Sustainable Construction | Introduction, Types & Benefits | Civil Engineering | Construction Materials

In this video, we delve into Green Building Materials and Sustainable Construction practices, covering their introduction, important properties, environmental advantages, and applications in modern infrastructure. These materials are crucial for eco-friendly building projects, aiming to reduce environmental impact and enhance energy efficiency.

This lecture provides a simple bilingual explanation (Hindi + English) specially designed for Polytechnic and Diploma Civil Engineering students to help them clearly understand the concept of green building materials and their role in sustainable development within the subject Construction Materials.

Green building materials are gaining prominence due to their durability, resource efficiency, low embodied energy, and contribution to healthier indoor environments. They are commonly used in residential homes, commercial complexes, public infrastructure, and urban planning projects focused on sustainability.

