es impossible to ignore: Our visible universe is merely a shimmering thread in a much grander, unseen design. And somewhere within its infinite expanse, the ultimate secrets of existence await their discovery. #cosmology #darkmatter #darkenergy #universe #space #sciencedocumentary #cosmos #bigbang #astrophysics #fulldocumentary",Cosmic Enigmas,20
