The Silent Takeover: How Your Smart Home Can Be Hacked for Blackmail and More,"Your smart home devices promise convenience, but they can also open a silent backdoor into your life, becoming instruments for blackmail, surveillance, or even physical danger. From smart thermostats to security cameras and digital assistants, the interconnectedness that simplifies our lives can be exploited by adversaries seeking data, control, or a way into your broader digital footprint.

