Watch the incredible Elephant Toothpaste reaction as a huge column of foam erupts! 🧪✨ This classic chemistry demonstration showcases the rapid decomposition of hydrogen peroxide, catalyzed by a common ingredient.

🧪 What you’ll see in this video:
⚡ Gigantic foam eruption
