👁️ Excessive Screen Time: Strains eyes, disrupts natural sleep cycles, and can lead to 'tech neck' and poor posture.

🪑 Sedentary Lifestyle: Weakens muscles, slows metabolism, and puts stress on your cardiovascular system, contributing to stiffness and fatigue.

⏰ Skipping Meals & Irregular Eating: Confuses your metabolism, leads to energy crashes, and can negatively impact digestion and blood sugar levels.

🧠 Chronic Stress: Elevates cortisol, leading to inflammation, compromised immunity, poor gut health, and premature aging of cells.

💧 Dehydration: Dulls skin, impairs cognitive function, strains kidneys, and reduces overall energy and mood. Drink up!

