Top 5 Phlebotomy Mistakes & How to Prevent Them! #LabTips #BloodDraw #Phlebotomy,"Avoid common pitfalls in blood collection! This video covers the top 5 phlebotomy mistakes and provides practical tips to ensure accurate samples and patient safety.

1️⃣ Incorrect Patient Identification: Always verify with two identifiers.
2️⃣ Improper Vein Selection: Choose appropriate veins and needle sizes to prevent multiple sticks.
3️⃣ Incorrect Order of Draw: Follow the precise order of draw to avoid cross-contamination of additives.
4️⃣ Hemolysis: Prevent sample breakdown by using correct needle gauge and gentle technique.
