Why do heavy and light objects fall at the SAME speed? 🤔💨 #PhysicsTrivia #Einstein,"Why do heavy and light objects fall at the SAME speed in a vacuum? 🤔 It's a classic paradox that reveals a fundamental truth about our universe! This physics trivia puzzle will challenge your understanding of gravity!

