Day 35 🌿 Losing Hair? Understand Why and Try These Natural Ayurvedic Solutions!,"Experiencing hair fall can be distressing, and often it's a sign that your body needs a little extra care. Common causes include stress, nutritional deficiencies, hormonal changes, and harsh hair products.

According to Ayurveda, hair fall is frequently linked to an imbalance of Pitta dosha (leading to inflammation and weak roots) or Vata dosha (causing dryness and brittleness). A balanced diet and lifestyle are crucial for healthy hair.

🌿 **Simple Ayurvedic home remedies for hair fall:**
• Gently massage your scalp with warm **coconut oil, bhringraj oil, or amla oil** 2-3 times a week to improve circulation and strengthen roots.
• Apply a **fenugreek seed (methi) paste** as a hair mask once a week. Soak seeds overnight, grind them, and apply for 30 minutes before washing.
• Include **protein-rich foods, leafy greens, and nuts** in your diet to nourish your hair from within.
• Manage stress through **yoga, meditation, or deep breathing exercises**.
• Avoid hot water showers and harsh chemical-based shampoos.

✨ Embrace these natural practices for stronger, healthier, and more vibrant hair over time.

