IaC Drift Detection in CI/CD - Prevent Configuration Skew," Are manual infrastructure changes causing nightmares in your IaC pipelines? Is configuration drift a constant threat to your system stability and security? In this technical deep dive, we explore how DevOps teams can automatically detect and prevent configuration drift in their CI/CD pipelines.

