*   Prof. David Chen: Professor of Theoretical Physics & Cryptography, Imperial University.
    *   Topic: Post-Quantum Cryptography: Building the Next Generation of Secure Algorithms.
*   Ms. Sarah Lee: Cybersecurity Strategist, Quantum Innovations Corp.
    *   Topic: Practical Implications for Enterprises: Preparing for the Quantum Threat Landscape.
*   Moderator: Dr. Mark Johnson: Senior Analyst, FutureTech Nexus.

