What if you never slept again? 😴 #sleepfacts #bodyfacts #science #whatif,"What if you never slept again? 😴At first… you might feel a surge of energy, like you've unlocked extra hours in the day.But within 24 hours, cognitive functions start to decline. You'll struggle to focus, your memory will falter, and your mood will become erratic.By day 2, microsleeps begin – brief, involuntary moments of sleep where your brain switches off for seconds at a time, even if your eyes are open. Hallucinations might start.By day 3, severe sleep deprivation can lead to significant psychological and physical impairment, blurring the lines of reality. Your immune system weakens, and your body's ability to repair itself is severely compromised.And if sleep continues to be withheld…the consequences can be dire, affecting everything from your mental health to the functioning of every organ.Because the truth is simple—sleep isn't a luxury; it's a fundamental necessity for survival, just as vital as food and water.#whatif#sciencefacts#sleepprivation#humanbody#brainfacts#didyouknow#interestingfacts#scienceexplained#healthfacts#youtubeshorts#viralshorts#factsdaily#youtubeshort",The Biological Blueprint,2500
