Crispy Honey Garlic Shrimp with Garlic Noodles Recipe | Flavor Forge,"Mouth-watering Crispy Honey Garlic Shrimp served with flavorful Garlic Noodles by your favorite culinary channel, Flavor Forge! This easy-to-follow recipe brings restaurant-quality flavors right to your kitchen. #FlavorForge #CrispyShrimp #HoneyGarlic #GarlicNoodles #DinnerIdeas

Written Recipe: [imaginary-link-to-blog.com/honey-garlic-shrimp]

Serves 2-3
Recipe in English:

Ingredients:
Prepare Crispy Honey Garlic Shrimp:
- Large Shrimp (peeled, deveined, tail-on) 1 lb
- Cornstarch 3 tbs
- Salt ½ tsp
- Black pepper ¼ tsp
- Vegetable oil 3-4 tbs (for frying)

For Honey Garlic Sauce:
- Honey ¼ Cup
- Soy sauce 3 tbs
- Minced Garlic 2 tbs
- Grated Ginger 1 tbs
- Rice Vinegar 1 tbs
- Sesame oil ½ tbs
- Red Pepper Flakes ½ tsp (optional)

Prepare Garlic Noodles:
- Egg Noodles (or preferred noodles) 8 oz
- Butter 3 tbs
- Minced Garlic 4 cloves
- Soy Sauce 1 tbs
- Oyster Sauce 1 tbs (optional, for umami)
- Brown Sugar ½ tsp
- Black Pepper ¼ tsp
- Fresh Parsley (chopped) 2 tbs

Directions:
Prepare Crispy Honey Garlic Shrimp:
- Pat shrimp dry with paper towels. In a bowl, toss shrimp with cornstarch, salt, and pepper until evenly coated.
- Heat vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.
- Fry shrimp in batches for 2-3 minutes per side, until golden brown and crispy. Remove and set aside on a plate lined with paper towels.

Prepare Honey Garlic Sauce:
- In a small bowl, whisk together honey, soy sauce, minced garlic, grated ginger, rice vinegar, sesame oil, and red pepper flakes.
- Drain excess oil from the skillet, leaving about 1 tbs. Pour the sauce into the skillet and bring to a simmer over medium heat, cooking for 1-2 minutes until slightly thickened.
- Add the crispy shrimp back into the skillet and toss gently to coat evenly with the sauce.

Prepare Garlic Noodles:
- Cook noodles according to package directions. Drain and set aside.
- In a separate large skillet or wok, melt butter over medium heat. Add minced garlic and sauté for 1 minute until fragrant.
- Add cooked noodles, soy sauce, oyster sauce (if using), brown sugar, and black pepper. Toss well to combine and heat through for 2-3 minutes.
- Stir in chopped fresh parsley.

Serve:
- Arrange garlic noodles on plates. Top with the crispy honey garlic shrimp. Garnish with extra fresh parsley or sesame seeds if desired. Enjoy!",Flavor Forge,110500
Lecture_11 Series combination of resistors_Unit 14 Class 10 Physics _Asaan physics pushto lecture,"Lecture 11

Series Combination of Resistors

Unit 14: Current Electricity | Class 10 Physics | Asaan Physics (Pashto Lecture)

In this lecture, we explain the series combination of resistors in a simple and easy Pashto language, especially designed for Class 10 students studying Current Electricity.

A series combination of resistors is a circuit arrangement in which resistors are connected end-to-end, forming a single path for the flow of electric current.

Key Concepts Covered in This Lecture

✔ Definition of series combination of resistors
✔ Flow of current in series circuits
✔ Different potential difference across each resistor
✔ Formula for equivalent resistance in series combination
✔ Effect of adding more resistors
✔ Advantages and disadvantages
✔ Comparison with parallel combination
✔ Daily life examples (Christmas lights, simple switches)
✔ Important exam points and numericals concept

Important Results
 • Current through each resistor is same
 • Voltage divides among different resistors
 • Total resistance is greater than the largest individual resistance
 • If one resistor fails, the entire circuit breaks.
This lecture is very useful for:
 • Board exam preparation
 • Conceptual understanding
 • Numerical problem solving
 • Entry tests and viva

