"미중 기술 경쟁이 글로벌 반도체 공급망에 어떤 압력을 가하는가 | 뉴스어휘 bottleneck, decouple, leverage, pivotal","#vocabulary #shorts #뉴스어휘 bottleneck, decouple, leverage, pivotal, tariffs, resilience, indigenous, geopolitical  bottleneck (병목 현상) 보틀넥 We're actually seeing a bottleneck in global electronics manufacturing due to chip shortages. 현재의 칩 부족으로 인해 글로벌 전자 제품 제조에 병목 현상이 나타나고 있습니다.  decouple (디커플링/분리하다) 디커플 Nations are increasingly seeking to decouple their critical supply chains from geopolitical risks. 국가들은 점점 더 중요한 공급망을 지정학적 위험으로부터 분리(decouple)하려고 노력하고 있습니다.  leverage (영향력을 행사하다/지렛대 효과) 레버리지 Governments are attempting to leverage their market power to secure domestic chip production. 정부들은 자국의 시장 영향력을 국내 칩 생산 확보에 활용(leverage)하려고 시도하고 있습니다.  pivotal (중추적인/매우 중요한) 피보탈 The role of advanced chip manufacturing in national security is becoming increasingly pivotal. 국가 안보에서 첨단 칩 제조의 역할은 점점 더 중추적(pivotal)이 되고 있습니다. ------ All rights belong to the original creator. This video is repurposed for educational use. How The US-China Tech Rivalry Pressures Global Semiconductor Supply Chains 미중 기술 경쟁이 글로벌 반도체 공급망에 어떤 압력을 가하는가 ------ This material is provided solely for English learning purposes, including vocabulary study and reading comprehension. It does not express opinions or judgments regarding real-world events, individuals, organizations, or policies. Nothing in this content should be interpreted as political, legal, financial, or professional advice of any kind. All example sentences are used strictly as language-learning references. Please use this material exclusively for educational purposes. thank you.",Global News English,1050
WHAT AN AI DATA CENTER SERVER RACK LOOKS LIKE WITHOUT ITS CASING,"You stream a video, send a message, or ask an AI a question... it's powered by a hidden world of raw computation. Remove the sleek enclosure of a server rack, and you're staring into a hurricane of technology.

Thousands of gleaming circuit boards, interconnected by a dense spaghetti of fiber optics and copper. Blazing hot processors, cooled by roaring fans pushing air at incredible speeds. Power distribution units handling enough electricity to light a small town.

Every blink of light, every whir of a fan, is a calculation, a transaction, a piece of your digital life being processed at the speed of light. This isn't just a machine; it's the digital nervous system of the modern world, a controlled inferno of information, operating 24/7.

The AI models you interact with daily – generative art, smart assistants, complex simulations – live and breathe within these metal confines, demanding immense computational power. They push these bare, buzzing machines to their limits, enabling the digital experiences we now take for granted.

Modern digital infrastructure hides an incredible amount of dangerous, complex engineering behind sleek, uniform rack fronts. The raw power of an AI data center is both terrifying and awe-inspiring. Would you still trust your data to these bare, buzzing machines if you saw them in action?

#ArtificialIntelligence #DataCenter #Tech #Engineering #Servers #CloudComputing #MachineLearning #TechUnveiled",DataDive,4875
