"Master Programming Paradigms in 10 Minutes—From Procedural to Functional, OOP, and Beyond!","10 Minutes to Understand Every Major Programming Paradigm | No Code, Just Simple Concepts
Description
Want to grasp the core philosophies behind how we write software without diving into complex code? This 10-minute video breaks down EVERY major programming paradigm—from the traditional (Procedural, Object-Oriented) to the modern (Functional, Declarative)—and even touches on less common ones. We keep it quick, conceptual, and easy to follow, so you’ll know exactly how each approach shapes software development.
Programming Paradigms Covered:
✅ Procedural – The foundational step-by-step approach.
✅ Object-Oriented (OOP) – Organizing code around 'objects' and classes.
✅ Functional – Building programs with pure functions and immutability.
✅ Declarative – Focusing on 'what' to do, rather than 'how'.
✅ Logic – Expressing computation in terms of formal logic.
✅ Event-Driven – Reacting to events in real-time.
