In this video, we break down the hidden strategic game playing out beneath the headlines of trade wars and technological competition — one that isn't just about tariffs or IP theft. It's about rare earth elements, lithium, cobalt, the control of processing facilities, and a global supply chain architecture that is increasingly weaponized.

