QuantumChat vs. NovaSpeak: The Data Leak Nobody's Talking About (2025),"Everyone's flocking to QuantumChat and NovaSpeak as the future of secure communication, but are they really? What if one of them is silently broadcasting your most private conversations to third-party servers? I dived deep into both 'secure' communication platforms, and what I uncovered about their backend protocols and data handling policies was genuinely alarming for one of them.

