UV-Vis Spectrophotometer Calibration & Usage in Hindi: Labman UV-2000 Step-by-Step Guide for Accurate Results,"#Spectrophotometer #UVVis #Labman #CalibrationGuide #AnalyticalChemistry #Biochemistry #LabEquipment #LabHacks #ScienceIndia #ChemistryLab #ResearchLab #QualityControl #PharmaLab #Education #LabTutorial Is video mein hum Labman UV-2000 UV-Vis Spectrophotometer ki complete calibration aur accurate usage process ko step-by-step Hindi mein cover karenge. Chahe aap student ho, lab technician, ya researcher, yeh guide aapko sahi readings lene mein madad karegi. Spectrophotometer readings ki accuracy bahut important hai experiments aur analysis ke liye. Hum isme cover karenge: 1. **Unboxing & Setup:** Spectrophotometer ko lab bench par sahi jagah kaise rakhen aur power connections kaise karen. Ensure stable, vibration-free surface. Avoid direct sunlight. 2. **Instrument Warm-up:** Best performance ke liye kitna warm-up time zaroori hai. Minimum 15-20 minutes warm-up is crucial. 3. **Wavelength Calibration:** Wavelength accuracy check karne ke liye Holmium Oxide filter (ya similar standard) ka use kaise karen. ""On Screen Text: Holmium Oxide Filter से Wavelength Calibration सीखें!"" 4. **Absorbance Baseline Correction:** Blank solution (solvent) ka use karke baseline kaise set karen for zero absorbance. Use the same cuvette for blank and sample. 5. **Cuvette Handling & Sample Preparation:** Sample cuvettes ko kaise handle karen, air bubbles kaise avoid karen, aur dilution tips. ""Pro Tip: Cuvette ki polished sides ko kabhi touch na karen."" 6. **Measurement Procedure:** Sample ko measure kaise karen aur results ko record kaise karen. Setting wavelength range, scanning, and single point measurement. 7. **Common Mistakes & Troubleshooting:** Spectrophotometer readings mein aane wali common problems aur unka solution. ""Warning: Dirty cuvettes, air bubbles, ya instrument drift readings galat kar sakte hain."" 8. **Maintenance & Cleaning:** Instrument ki proper cleaning aur care takay uski longevity bani rahe. Always use lint-free wipes. Yeh video especially useful hai for those jo analytical labs, biochemistry labs, pharmaceutical quality control, aur academic research mein kaam karte hain. Apne experiments mein reliable data ke liye yeh video zaroor dekhen! ""Spectrophotometer kaise calibrate karein?"" ""UV-Vis readings kaise lete hain?"" ""Labman UV-2000 guide"" ""Analytical instrument setup"" Key Learnings: ✔ Proper warm-up time is essential. ✔ Always use calibrated standards for accuracy. ✔ Cleanliness of cuvettes directly impacts results. ✔ Regular maintenance ensures instrument longevity. Similar Searches: ""UV-Vis Spectrophotometer Basic Operation Tutorial"" ""How to Calibrate Spectrophotometer for Beginners"" ""Lab Instrument Setup Guide UV-Vis"" ""Spectrophotometer Troubleshooting Tips""",LabPro India,150
How Long Can You Survive in Space? 🚀 #shorts #viral,"What happens if you're suddenly exposed to the chilling vacuum of space? 🌌

At 0 seconds, the air would rip from your lungs, but you wouldn't explode. Your saliva would boil on your tongue.

Within 15 seconds, the lack of oxygen to your brain would cause you to lose consciousness, but you'd be aware of your body swelling.

After 90 seconds, your blood would start to deoxygenate rapidly, and your internal organs would suffer irreparable damage from decompression.

Beyond 2 minutes, your blood vessels would rupture, tissues would freeze, and cosmic radiation would begin to bombard your unprotected body.

The most terrifying truth? Even if you were rescued after a few minutes, the irreversible damage would mean a slow, agonizing end. And you'd have been awake for the worst of it.

