Project Lighthouse Diaries Episode 5: Funding Our Future | The Real Cost of Sustainable Community Programs,"Hey Impact Builders family, it’s Alex and Chloe.

Welcome back to Project Lighthouse Diaries, our behind-the-scenes series showing what it truly takes to bring a community vision to life. We’re deep into building Project Lighthouse, our new inclusive community hub, and this week we’re tackling a topic that’s often misunderstood: finances and long-term sustainability.

Today, we’re not just looking at initial grants. We’re talking about the big picture, the “why” behind every budget line, and how money is the bedrock that protects our mission of fostering a thriving, supportive community.

⸻

