Giant Combine Harvester Unleashed: Extreme Wheat Harvest!,"Witness the colossal power of the latest combine harvester as it meticulously reaps a vast wheat field. This technological marvel efficiently cuts, threshes, and cleans grain in a single, awe-inspiring pass, transforming acres of crops into a valuable harvest with unparalleled speed and precision.
Tool Name:
John Deere X9 1100 Combine
Estimated Price:
$700,000 – $1,200,000+ USD (depending on configuration & header)
Specifications:
Engine Power: Up to 700 HP
Grain Tank Capacity: 16,200 liters (460 bushels)
Header Width: Up to 50 ft (15.2 m)
Unload Rate: 186 liters/sec (5.3 bushels/sec)
Weight: ~28,000 kg (62,000 lbs)
Drive Type: ProDrive XL Transmission
Threshing System: Twin Rotary
Precision Ag: Integrated StarFire 7000 GPS Receiver
Advantages:
Unmatched harvesting capacity
Minimizes grain loss with advanced separation
Integrated smart farming technology
Superior operator comfort and control
Efficient fuel consumption for its size
Disadvantages:
Extremely high initial investment
Requires highly skilled operation and maintenance
Large size can be challenging for transport and smaller fields
Complex systems increase repair potential
Working Principle:
The combine's header cuts and feeds the crop into the machine. Inside, twin rotors thresh and separate the grain from the straw. The grain then passes through cleaning sieves and is transported to the onboard grain tank. Cleaned straw is either spread evenly across the field or chopped and ejected.
Productivity Impact:
This combine can harvest hundreds of acres per day, significantly reducing harvest time and labor costs. Its precision systems optimize yield, minimize waste, and provide valuable data for future farming decisions, leading to maximum profitability for large-scale operations.
