ibly, offering actionable insights for organizations looking to harness AI's power while mitigating risks and ensuring societal benefit. Subscribe for more in-depth discussions with trailblazing leaders shaping the future of AI. ----------------------------------- Who Is Dr. Anya Sharma? Dr. Anya Sharma is the Chief AI Ethics Officer at OmniCorp, a global technology conglomerate. With a distinguished career spanning AI research, philosophy, and corporate governance, Dr. Sharma leads initiatives focused on developing and implementing ethical guidelines for AI technologies. Her work ensures that OmniCorp's AI solutions are not only innovative but also fair, transparent, and accountable. She advocates for a human-centric approach to AI, believing that ethical considerations must be at the forefront of technological advancement to build trust and foster sustainable growth. ----------------------------------- Who Is Mark Chen? Mark Chen is the Vice President of AI Strategy at FutureTech Solutions, a leading firm in advanced analytics and machine learning. With over 15 years of experience, Mark specializes in architecting and scaling enterprise-level AI applications, transitioning them from pilot projects to impactful business solutions. He focuses on creating robust AI roadmaps, optimizing resource allocation, and fostering innovation while ensuring operational efficiency. Mark is passionate about demystifying AI for business leaders and empowering teams to leverage cutting-edge technologies responsibly. ----------------------------------- Follow Dr. Anya Sharma Here: LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/dranyasharma/ Follow Mark Chen Here: LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/markchenai/ ---------------------------------- About Strategic AI Leaders: Strategic AI Leaders is your premier platform for deep dives into the world of artificial intelligence with industry pioneers and thought leaders. We bring you conversations that demystify complex AI concepts, explore strategic implementations, and address the ethical challenges and opportunities in the rapidly evolving AI landscape. Our mission is to equip business executives and technology enthusiasts with the knowledge and insights needed to navigate the AI revolution successfully. ----------------------------------- Follow Strategic AI Leaders On Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/strategicaileaders/ Twitter: https://x.com/StrategicAI LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/strategic-ai-leaders/",Strategic AI Leaders,215
