🤯 You Won't Believe These 5 Everyday Science Tricks! ✨ (Easy Home Experiments),"Get ready to be amazed by these mind-bending science tricks using common household items! From making water defy gravity to creating a colorful density tower, these experiments look like pure magic but are all based on fascinating scientific principles. Perfect for all ages – watch till the end to see the incredible results!

✨ Tricks Explained (Simple):

🍋 Invisible Ink: Lemon juice, when heated, oxidizes and turns brown, revealing hidden messages.

🌈 Density Tower: Liquids like honey, dish soap, water, and oil layer themselves because they have different densities.

📎 Floating Paperclip: Surface tension of water is strong enough to support the weight of a small metal paperclip.

🥛 Water-Defying Glass: Atmospheric pressure pushing up on the card is greater than the weight of the water pushing down, holding the water in place.

