"Hybridization in Organic Chemistry Explained | sp, sp2, sp3 & How to Identify (NEET/JEE/11th/12th)","Aaj ki video mein hum Organic Chemistry ke ek aur bahut important concept, Hybridization, ko samjhenge. Jaise Primary/Secondary carbon important hai, waise hi Hybridization (sp, sp2, sp3) samajhna bhi Organic Reactions aur bonding ke liye zaroori hai. Agar aap Organic Chemistry padh rahe ho to yeh concept aapki foundation strong karega.

Is video mein aap seekhenge:
• Hybridization kya hai aur kyon zaroori hai?
• sp Hybridization kya hota hai aur kaise pehchanein?
• sp2 Hybridization kya hota hai aur kaise pehchanein?
• sp3 Hybridization kya hota hai aur kaise pehchanein?
• Easy tricks aur examples jisse aap kisi bhi carbon atom ka hybridization turant identify kar paoge.

Simple explanation:
Hybridization atomic orbitals ka intermixing hai jo new hybrid orbitals banata hai for bonding.
sp Hybridization: Jab 2 sigma bonds aur 2 pi bonds ho (e.g., Alkynes).
sp2 Hybridization: Jab 3 sigma bonds aur 1 pi bond ho (e.g., Alkenes).
sp3 Hybridization: Jab 4 sigma bonds ho (e.g., Alkanes).

Yeh topic Class 11, Class 12 Organic Chemistry, NEET, JEE aur Board Exams ke liye bahut important hai. Agar aapko Organic Chemistry ki deep understanding chahiye to video ko end tak zaroor dekhein.

&#128077; Like | Share | Subscribe for more Chemistry concept videos.

#chemistry #organicchemistry #hybridization #sphbridization #sp2hybridization #sp3hybridization #neet #jee #class11 #class12",ConceptBridge Chemistry,35
What Happens If You Go Into Space Without A Suit? 🚀 #shorts #space,"Ever wondered what would actually happen if you stepped out of a spaceship without protection? Forget Hollywood explosions! While it's certainly fatal, your body won't instantly freeze or explode. The vacuum of space would primarily cause a rapid loss of oxygen, leading to unconsciousness within seconds. Your blood and other body fluids would boil due to the extreme low pressure (a process called ebullism), causing painful swelling. You'd also experience severe decompression sickness and radiation exposure. But before any of that, the lack of oxygen would be the immediate killer. So, always wear your spacesuit! #Space #Science #Astronauts",EXPLR,780
