Dive deep with Coral the curious clownfish and Dr. Finnegan the knowledgeable octopus on an undersea musical adventure! Coral is on a quest to find the ocean's most colorful spot, but what she discovers is even more amazing: the living, breathing city of a coral reef! In this upbeat educational music video, kids will swim through vibrant polyps, learn about the amazing algae that give coral its color, and understand why these underwater wonders are so important – and what happens when they get ""stressed."" Set to a bouncy, tropical pop beat with a hint of Reggaeton, this song makes marine biology a splashy dance party!

