Kya Billi Zinda bhi hai aur Mari hui bhi? | Schrödinger's Cat Paradox | #shorts #science,"Kya Billi Zinda bhi hai aur Mari hui bhi? | Schrödinger's Cat Paradox | #shorts #science  Schrödinger's Cat quantum physics ka ek famous thought experiment hai.  Is experiment me ek imaginary billi ko ek box me band kiya jata hai, jahan ek radioactive sample aur zehar ki vial hoti hai.  Jab tak box khola nahi jata, quantum mechanics ke hisaab se, billi ek 'superposition' state me hoti hai, yaani woh ek hi waqt par zinda bhi hai aur mari hui bhi.  Ye experiment quantum world ke ajab niyam aur hamare daily life ke perception ke beech ke antar ko samjhata hai.  Is video me hum simple language me Schrödinger's Cat ko samjhenge.  #SchrodingersCat #QuantumPhysics #PhysicsInHindi  #QuantumMechanics #ThoughtExperiment #ScienceShorts #Shorts  schrodingers cat  schrodingers cat explained  schrodingers cat in hindi  quantum physics explained  quantum mechanics for beginners  physics shorts hindi  science explained hindi",Vigyan Vedhshala,3100
