This video is perfect for anyone diving into DIY lighting, electronics projects, or just curious about how those colorful LED strips work. We'll explore potential reasons for color confusion, such as:

*   Incorrect wiring polarity (e.g., common anode vs. common cathode)
*   Loose connections
*   Improper resistor values (if applicable)
