LabInsights Ep 05: Dr. Anya Sharma on spatial transcriptomics & brain development #genetics #neuroscience,"Welcome to LabInsights, where we explore groundbreaking research and the brilliant minds behind it. In this episode, we feature Dr. Anya Sharma, a leading postdoctoral researcher in the lab of Prof. Lena Mueller at the Max Planck Institute for Brain Research in Frankfurt, Germany. Dr. Sharma discusses her recent work, now available as a preprint, demonstrating how advanced spatial transcriptomics techniques are revolutionizing our understanding of cellular heterogeneity and lineage specification during early brain development. Her research sheds light on novel gene regulatory networks orchestrating cortical folding and neurogenesis.Link to preprint: https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2026.05.15.987654v1.fullLink to LabInsight highlight (prepared by Alex Chen): https://labinsights.biolsci.com/highlights/spatial-transcriptomics-brain-development/Link to Dr. Sharma's ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-2345-6789LabInsight recorded and edited by: Dr. Sarah Jones, Research Communications Lead, BioConnect MediaLabInsights is brought to you by BioConnect Media, fostering connections across biological sciences.",BioConnect Media,387
