Dancing Raisins Magic! 🍇✨ Soda & Raisins Experiment | Density & Gas Bubbles #shorts #science #fun,"Dancing Raisins Ka Magic! 🍇✨ Is fun experiment mein hum dekhenge ki kaise ordinary raisins soda water mein upar-neeche dance karte hain. Yeh dekhne mein jaise magic lagta hai, par iske peeche hai fascinating science!

Is experiment ke liye, aapko chahiye ek glass soda water (sparkling water) aur kuch kishmish (raisins). Jaise hi aap raisins ko soda mein daalte hain, aap dekhenge ki CO₂ (carbon dioxide) gas ke chhote-chhote bubbles raisins ki surface se chipak jaate hain. Jab kaafi bubbles chipak jaate hain, toh raisins ka density kam ho jaata hai aur woh upar tairne lagte hain. Surface par aate hi, bubbles phat jaate hain, aur raisins phir se heavy hokar neeche doob jaate hain. Yeh process repeat hota rehta hai, jisse lagta hai ki raisins dance kar rahe hain! 🕺💃

Yeh ek simple aur entertaining science experiment hai jo ghar par aasani se kiya ja sakta hai. Isse aap density, buoyancy aur gas formation ke concepts ko mazedaar tareeke se samajh sakte ho.

⚠️ Safety: Yeh experiment bilkul safe hai aur bachon ke liye bhi bahut educational hai.

