 NeuroGenesis: AI Agents That Rewire Their Own Neural Networks In Real-Time | Open Source," NeuroGenesis — The world's first autonomous neural architecture evolution system for AI agents.

Your AI agent's architecture is static. Tasks change, data evolves, performance plateaus — and you're stuck manually redesigning and retraining. NeuroGenesis fixes this by enabling agents to dynamically modify their own neural networks.

⚡ What NeuroGenesis Does:
• 5-layer architectural genome (Core Identity → Modifiable Synapses → Adaptive Layers → Task-Specific Modules → Environmental Epigenomes)
• SHA-512 integrity protection for core architectural principles — stability NEVER mutates uncontrollably
• 12-stage validation pipeline before any architectural change is committed
• 35 adaptive systems: architectural self-awareness, meta-learning, resource optimization, failure recovery, and more
• Drop-in integration: swap `model.train()` → `genome.adapt()` — that's it

 Adaptive Systems Include:
→ Dynamic Synaptic Pruning (optimizes connections based on utility)
→ Adaptive Layer Generation (adds/removes layers based on task complexity)
→ Real-time Performance Feedback (reinforcement learning for structural changes)
→ Architectural Genome Mapping (blueprint for self-modification)
→ Resource Allocation Unit (optimizes compute/memory usage)
→ Failure Recovery System (reverts to stable architectural states)
→ Self-Scrutiny Engine (identifies architectural bottlenecks and inefficiencies)
→ And 28 more...

 Quick Start (free, no API keys):
npm install @cogforge-ai/neurogenesis
npx tsx examples/evolution-demo.ts --dry-run

 Configuration Presets:
• minimal_adapt — 5 flags, basic structural adjustments
• balanced_evolve — 18 flags, production-ready adaptive agents
• aggressive_rewire — 25 flags, experimental rapid architectural transformation
• full_neurogenesis — 35 flags, everything enabled for deep evolution

 Links:
→ GitHub: https://github.com/CogForgeAI/neurogenesis
→ Website: https://neurogenesis-ai.com
→ Docs: https://neurogenesis-ai.com/docs
→ npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@cogforge-ai/neurogenesis

 Stats:
• 2,137 tests passing
• 15 packages
• 35 adaptive systems
• Apache 2.0 License (free forever)

️ Tags:
Innovation — Created by CognitiveForge AI Research Lab

#AI #OpenSource #NeuralNetworks #SelfModifyingAI #DeepLearning #AdaptiveAI #MachineLearning #TypeScript #NodeJS #AgentAI #Neurogenesis",CognitiveForge AI,187
