"Cracking the Code: How to Fund Your MedTech Startup & Avoid Investor Red Flags | Dr. Anya Sharma, Bio-Venture Capitalist","Securing investment for a MedTech startup is notoriously challenging. The long development cycles, high regulatory hurdles, and significant capital expenditure often deter even the most seasoned investors. But what if there was a playbook to navigate this complex landscape?

