💨 Radon Gas – The Invisible Lung Threat in Your Home #RadonAwareness #HomeHealth #InvisibleKiller,"💨 Radon Gas – The Silent Danger Lurking in Your Home

Radon is an invisible, odorless, and tasteless radioactive gas that can silently build up inside your house. It's the leading cause of lung cancer among non-smokers, seeping in from the soil, rocks, and water beneath your foundation.

This 60-second Short explains what radon is, how it gets into your home, the serious health risks it poses, and why testing your home is the ONLY way to detect it. Learn about simple, inexpensive testing methods and the importance of mitigation to protect your family's health.

