Jab Jheel Ugalne Lagi Maut: Lake Nyos Ka Darawna Raaz,"Kya prakriti itni shant bhi ho sakti hai ki bina kisi shor ke hazaron logon ki jaan le le? Lake Nyos ki kahani insaniyat ko hila dene wala ek aisa hi sach hai, jahan ek jheel ne maut ka kohra ugal diya! 1986 mein Cameroon mein, Lake Nyos se achanak ek zehreeli gas ka badal utha aur poore gaon ko apni chapet mein le liya. Hazaron log, jaanwar, sabhi ek pal mein neend mein hi mar gaye. Na koi bhookamp, na jwalamukhi, bas ek ""Limnic Eruption"" jisse carbon dioxide (CO2) ki ghanatv wali gas jheel se bahar aayi aur hawa se zyada bhaari hone ke karan zameen par phail gayi, sabko saans ghont kar maar diya. Kya yeh sirf ek prakritik aafat thi, ya iske peeche koi gehra raaz chupa hai? Aapke kya vichaar hain, comments mein zaroor batayein! Video pasand aayi toh Like aur Share karein, aur aise hi prakritik rahasyon aur vigyan ke andekhe sach ke liye Subscribe karna na bhoolein! #️⃣ Hashtags: #LakeNyos #LimnicEruption #NaturalDisaster #ScienceMystery #CarbonDioxide #SilentKiller #GeologyFacts #AfricanTragedy #DarkScience #MindBlowingFacts #DuniyaKeRahasya #AjeebGareeb #KnowledgeInHindi #HindiScience #CreepyFactsHindi #FactShorts #TrendingFacts #DailyFacts #ViralShorts #EduTok",Vigyan Ke Andekhe Sach,420
