After 50: Why Wild Salmon Beats Fish Oil Pills for Heart & Brain Health,"Are you taking fish oil supplements for your Omega-3s? For those over 50, mounting evidence suggests that getting these crucial fatty acids from whole food sources like wild salmon offers superior benefits compared to pills.

