Voice-over Description (300 characters):
Witness the future of farming with this intelligent corn planter! Featuring GPS accuracy and automated controls, it ensures perfect seed placement, boosting germination rates and maximizing crop yields while dramatically cutting down on labor and seed waste.

🌱 Tool Name
AgriSmart Pro-Planter 8000 (8-Row Precision Corn Planter)

💰 Estimated Price in USD
$25,000 – $60,000 (attachment only)
$70,000 – $150,000 (planter + compatible tractor)

⚙️ Specifications
Working width: 6-9 meters (for 8-row models)
Planting speed: 8-16 km/h
Row spacing: Adjustable from 70-90 cm
Seed capacity: 200-400 liters per hopper
Tractor power required: 80-150 HP
GPS-guided auto-steer compatibility
Pneumatic or vacuum seed metering system
Individual row shut-off for section control
Hydraulic downforce for consistent depth
Electronic seed monitoring system

✅ Advantages
Ultra-high planting accuracy and uniformity
Significant reduction in seed wastage
Optimized plant spacing for maximum yield
Reduced labor costs and operational time
Improved germination rates and crop establishment
