⚙️ Working Principle
The AgriSmart Pro-Planter uses advanced GPS technology to guide the tractor and planter precisely across the field. A pneumatic or vacuum system precisely picks up individual seeds and places them at the exact desired depth and spacing. Hydraulic downforce maintains consistent planting depth, while individual row shut-offs prevent overplanting in irregular field sections. Electronic sensors continuously monitor seed flow and population, ensuring optimal performance.

📈 Productivity Impact
Planting speed increased by up to 2-3x compared to conventional planters
Seed cost reduced by 5-15% due to precision placement
Labor cost reduced by 40-60%
