THE GUT GLOW ELIXIR: Daily Ritual for Digestion & Vitality,"✨🌿✨🌿✨🌿✨

Unlock the secret to a happy gut and radiant glow with our signature Gut Glow Elixir! This simple, powerful blend combines nature's finest ingredients to support your digestion, boost your immune system, and leave you feeling energized from the inside out.

Each ingredient is a powerhouse: Apple Cider Vinegar aids digestion and balances gut flora, fresh ginger calms the stomach, turmeric offers potent anti-inflammatory benefits (especially with a pinch of black pepper!), and lemon adds a refreshing detoxifying touch. A hint of raw honey or maple syrup makes it delicious and provides natural sweetness.

✨ The perfect start to your day or a midday pick-me-up!

✨ INGREDIENTS:
– 1-2 tablespoons Apple Cider Vinegar (with the mother)
– 1 inch fresh ginger, grated
– ½ teaspoon turmeric powder
– Pinch of black pepper
– Juice of ½ lemon
– 1 teaspoon raw honey or maple syrup (optional)
– 1 cup warm water

✨ INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Grate ginger into a mug.
2. Add ACV, turmeric, black pepper, lemon juice, and sweetener (if using).
3. Pour warm water over the mixture and stir well until combined.
4. Enjoy immediately!

🌿 Rejuvenate. Digest. Thrive.

