Induction Motor Ke Working Principle Aur Uske Parts |⚡ Electrical Knowledge #inductionmotor #electrical,"Induction Motor Ke Working Principle Aur Uske Parts | Electrical Knowledge #inductionmotor #electrical #ai #knowledge @ElectroLearnHub 

⚡ Induction Motor ke working principle aur uske mukhya parts
Induction motor electrical engineering ka ek bohot important component hai. Is video mein hum iske working principle aur mukhya parts ko samjhenge. Jaise:

⭐ Stator – Motor ka stationary part jisme winding hoti hai jo magnetic field banati hai.
⭐ Rotor – Motor ka rotating part jo magnetic field ke interaction se ghumta hai.
⭐ Air Gap – Stator aur Rotor ke beech ka gap jahan magnetic field transfer hota hai.
⭐ Working Principle – Faraday's Law of Induction par based hai, jahan rotating magnetic field rotor mein current induce karta hai.

Ye sabhi parts aur principles milkar induction motor ko bohot se industrial aur domestic applications mein upyogi banate hain.

