Continuous 24/7 slipform operation for 8 weeks
Achieving 3m vertical gain per day
Tolerances maintained within +/- 5mm over 200m height
Automated jacking system with integrated sensor feedback

A critical verticality adjustment was made at floor 25.

It prevented a cumulative tilt that would have impacted the entire façade.

