Kuttu Atta & Paneer Cutlets | Fasting Snack | Air Fryer & Pan-Fry Options,"Kuttu Atta & Paneer Cutlets | Fasting Snack | Air Fryer & Pan-Fry Options @PurePlatesKitchen 

Looking for a delicious and healthy vrat snack? Try these Kuttu Atta and Paneer Cutlets, perfect for fasting days like Navratri, Ekadashi, or Shivratri. These cutlets are crispy on the outside, soft on the inside, and can be either pan-fried or air-fried for a healthier option!

This easy vrat recipe is packed with protein from paneer and energy from kuttu (buckwheat) flour, making it a satisfying and guilt-free snack. Enjoy them with a fresh mint chutney or your favorite fasting dip.

✨ Why you’ll love this recipe:

Vrat (fasting) friendly
Protein-rich & wholesome
Quick & easy to prepare
