Microsoft Excel Corrupted File Recovery: Top Fixes & Prevention Tips Before Buying Software,"In this video, we tackle the frustrating problem of corrupted Microsoft Excel files. Whether you're seeing 'Excel cannot open the file because the file format or file extension is not valid' errors, 'File not found' after a crash, or unexpected data loss, we'll guide you through practical, free steps to recover your valuable spreadsheets. We will discuss how to recognize signs of corruption, steps to take before attempting repairs, quick fixes such as using the built-in 'Open and Repair' function, saving in different formats, restoring previous versions, and methods for salvaging data from partially damaged files. We'll also briefly talk about using third-party recovery tools as a last resort and review best practices for preventing future corruption, including proper backups, avoiding common pitfalls, and managing large files.

